C               = 1 TRACE RE UP TO COMPUTATIONAL BOUNDARY (INCLUDING VACUUM REGION)
C               = 2 SAME AS KRE_VAC=1 BUT ALSO USE UTODE TO TRACE THROUGH PLASMA BOUNDARY 
C   KRE_BVAC  : = 1 (DEFAULT)
C               =-1 SWITCH SIGN OF BR AND BZ READ FROM EQDSK IN VACUUM REGION 
C                   IN ACTION WHEN KRE_VAC=1
C   KRE_PERTURB_TIME = 0 ASSUME STATIC PERTURBATION
C                    = 1 TIME-DEPENDENT PERTURBATION USING ALNORM AS EIGENVALUE.
C                        PERTURBATION AUTOMATICALLY RELAXES TO RE_PERTURB LEVEL 
C                        IF EXCEEDS RE_PERTURB_MAX ==> MIMIC SAWTEETH
C                        ALSO NEED TO SET RE_EFIELD=1.0, KRE_STAR=3.
C                    = 2 TIME-DEPENDENT PERTURBATION USING ALNORM AS EIGENVALUE.
C                        A GROWING PERTURBATION STARTS AT RE_PERTURB AND 
C                        SATURATES AT RE_PERTURB_MAX LEVEL.
C                    = 3 SIMILAR TO OPTION 2, BUT USE INPUT RE_EIGVAL AS EIGENVALUE.
