C               BE ADDED TO THE TOTAL PERTURBED FIELD, FOR RE TRACING
C               DEFAULT=0: ONLY SINGLE-N FIELD FROM PRESENT COMPUTATION WILL BE INCLUDED 
C   KRE_STAR  = 0: DO NOT INCLUDE STAR-CORRECTION TO B- AND E-FIELD
C               1: INCLUDE STAR-CORRECTION TO B-FIELD ONLY
C               2: INCLUDE STAR-CORRECTION TO E-FIELD ONLY
C               3: INCLUDE STAR-CORRECTION TO BOTH B- AND E-FIELD
C               4: INCLUDE WIENER PROCESS
C               5: INCLUDE ALL: STAR-CORRECTION TO BOTH B- AND E-FIELD, WIENER PROCESS
