C   RE_PERTURB: MULTIPLIER FOR ADDING PERTURBATIONS TO (E,B,J,V), NORMALLY 0.0, 1.0 OR 2.0
C   RE_PERTURB_MAX   = MAXIMUM PERTURBATION AMPLITUDE WHEN KRE_PERTURB_TIME=1 OR 2
