C   RE_SYNCH  : MULTIPLIER FOR SYNCHRONTRON RADIATION TERM IN RE MOMENT EQUATIONS, NORMALLY 0.0 OR 1.0
C   RE_BREMS  : MULTIPLIER FOR BREMSSTRAHLUNG TERM IN RE MOMENT EQUATIONS, NORMALLY 0.0 OR 1.0
C   RE_CONST  : ADDITIONAL INPUT CONSTANTS:
C               RE_CONST(1)=ON-AXIS ELECTRON DENSITY N_E IN [1/M^3]
C               RE_CONST(2)=COULOMB LOGARITHM [DIMENSIONLESS]  
C               RE_CONST(3)=Z=IMPURITY NUCLEUS CHARGE NUMBER [DIMENSIONLESS]
