C               <0: RE-CALCULATE INTERNALLY WITH ALEYNIKOV'S MODEL
C   RE_SP     : UNIFORM GRID IN S^(RE_SP)
C               RE_SP=2.0 ==> UNIFORM GRID IN PSI_P
